  <h1>Can Reaction-Order Geometry Screen Whole-Cell Model Interfaces?</h1>
  <p class="sub">A binding-equilibrium screen, a flux-balance counterexample, and a stability test</p>
  <p class="byline"><strong>zhuxiaomeng</strong> · Student ID 20261104507<br>Control and Computation in Biological Systems · Fall 2026</p>
